---
const CONTACT_EMAIL = 'contact@fortitudeendeavours.com';
---

<section id="contact" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-ink-2 py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 lg:px-10">
    <div class="reveal overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-gold/30 bg-panel">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-10 lg:p-14">
          <p class="mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold">
            Start the Conversation
          </p>
          <h2 class="text-balance font-display text-3xl font-medium leading-tight text-paper sm:text-4xl">
            Ready to build your financial freedom?
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-5 text-balance text-base leading-relaxed text-ash">
            Find out more about how your needs, desires and ambitions can be
            brought closer to reality.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-gold">
            The House &middot; The Boat &middot; The Succession Trust
          </p>

          <a
            href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}
            class="mt-8 flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full bg-gold px-4 py-3.5 text-xs font-semibold text-ink transition-transform hover:scale-[1.02] hover:bg-gold-light sm:inline-flex sm:w-auto sm:px-7 sm:text-sm"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="hidden h-4 w-4 shrink-0 sm:block" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.75 6.75v10.5a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25h-15a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25V6.75m19.5 0A2.25 2.25 0 0019.5 4.5h-15a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25m19.5 0v.243a2.25 2.25 0 01-1.07 1.916l-7.5 4.615a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.36 0L3.32 8.91a2.25 2.25 0 01-1.07-1.916V6.75" />
            </svg>
            <span>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</span>
          </a>

          <p class="mt-6 text-xs leading-relaxed text-ash-2">
            Trading forex, commodities and property involves risk, including the
            possible loss of capital. Past performance is not a reliable indicator
            of future results. Please ensure you understand the risks involved and
            seek independent advice where appropriate.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="relative hidden lg:block">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1486406146926-c627a92ad1ab?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"
            alt="Financial growth chart on a tablet, symbolising planning ahead"
            class="h-full w-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-l from-transparent via-transparent to-panel"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
